{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/uy51vo","slide":1,"text":"Welcome to National Health Intelligence Capstone. This lesson begins with one principle: national intelligence must integrate evidence, uncertainty, authority, and action. We will connect that principle to an accountable health decision and make it testable in the companion notebook.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N15, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
