{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/vo36g7","slide":3,"text":"These five controls form one operating chain. We begin with integrated evidence, move through surveillance and capacity, and finish with equity and accountability. Every control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N15, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
