{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/rq9kb2pw","slide":4,"text":"A national brief connects indicators, risks, resources, uncertainty, and authorized actions.","textPreview":"A national brief connects indicators, risks, resources, uncertainty, and authorized actions.","textChars":92,"textLines":1,"bbox":[88,280,630,110]}
