{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/70hpyu","slide":5,"text":"The notebook converts the lesson into executable evidence. Assemble and validate an accountable national health decision product. As you review the saved outputs, focus on what the evidence supports, what remains uncertain, and the condition that requires abstention or escalation.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N15, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
