{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/o7ihozad","slide":6,"text":"Transfer the contract to another sector","textPreview":"Transfer the contract to another sector","textChars":39,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,94,1100,52]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98rix4bi","slide":6,"text":"Choose health, education, agriculture, or habitat.","textPreview":"Choose health, education, agriculture, or habitat.","textChars":50,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,190,1050,40]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/250zmps7","slide":6,"text":"1","textPreview":"1","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,275,45,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n690vuts","slide":6,"text":"Name the decision owner and lawful action.","textPreview":"Name the decision owner and lawful action.","textChars":42,"textLines":1,"bbox":[116,272,800,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/03ihkfa1","slide":6,"text":"2","textPreview":"2","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,345,45,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/14ritkbm","slide":6,"text":"Define the evidence, horizon, and failure conditions.","textPreview":"Define the evidence, horizon, and failure conditions.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[116,342,800,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hkvydgfq","slide":6,"text":"3","textPreview":"3","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,415,45,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gjmxkvyl","slide":6,"text":"State when to abstain, escalate, monitor, and retire.","textPreview":"State when to abstain, escalate, monitor, and retire.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[116,412,800,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/vitgbqx0","slide":6,"bbox":[930,252,230,230]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uhkfilgf","slide":6,"text":"SUCCESS","textPreview":"SUCCESS","textChars":7,"textLines":1,"bbox":[960,280,170,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tgbe9gfu","slide":6,"text":"A reviewer can see\nwhat the system knows,\nwhat it cannot decide,\nand who remains accountable.","textPreview":"A reviewer can see | what the system knows, | what it cannot decide, | and who remains accountable.","textChars":93,"textLines":4,"bbox":[958,330,175,120]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/43o056","slide":6,"text":"Now transfer the contract to a new health-service case. Name the decision owner and lawful action. Define the evidence, horizon, and failure conditions. Then state when the system must abstain, escalate, be monitored, or be retired. A strong answer keeps human authority visible.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N15, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
