{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t8ryxw3m","slide":8,"text":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textPreview":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,568,1050,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rh2a0p","slide":8,"text":"Before deployment, ask five questions. Is integrated evidence clear? Is surveillance documented? Is capacity testable? Is equity governed? And is accountability explicit? If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer the system for review.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N15, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}